error[unguarded-release]: `unlock(cache_lock)` is skipped when code before it throws
 --> positive.jl:5:5
  |
3 |     lock(cache_lock)
  |     ---------------- acquired here
4 |     cache[key] = value
5 |     unlock(cache_lock)
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ skipped on exception
  |
  = why: exception between them leaves lock held; next `lock` call waits forever
  = fix: use `lock(cache_lock) do … end`   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain unguarded-release
  = note: deny from correctness group, library preset
  = note: opt out with `# corset: allow unguarded-release -- <reason>`

