error[unguarded-release]: `release(slots)` is skipped when code before it throws
  --> positive.jl:27:5
   |
25 |     acquire(slots)
   |     -------------- acquired here
26 |     work()
27 |     release(slots)
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ skipped on exception
   |
   = why: exception between them keeps semaphore slot; later `acquire` calls wait for it forever
   = fix: wrap code after `acquire(slots)` in `try … finally release(slots) end`   [manual]
   = docs: corset explain unguarded-release

error[unguarded-release]: `Base.release(slots)` is skipped when code before it throws
  --> positive.jl:34:5
   |
32 |     Base.acquire(slots)
   |     ------------------- acquired here
33 |     work()
