   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ skipped on exception
   |
   = why: exception between them keeps semaphore slot; later `acquire` calls wait for it forever
   = fix: wrap code after `Base.acquire(slots)` in `try … finally Base.release(slots) end`   [manual]
   = docs: corset explain unguarded-release

error[unguarded-release]: `close(io)` is skipped when code before it throws
  --> positive.jl:41:5
   |
39 |     io = open(path, "w")
   |     -------------------- acquired here
40 |     write(io, data)
41 |     close(io)
   |     ^^^^^^^^^ skipped on exception
   |
   = why: exception between them leaves file open until garbage collector finalizes it
   = fix: use `open(path, "w") do io … end`   [manual]
   = docs: corset explain unguarded-release

